-routeReserveSpaceForMultiCut {true|false}
                                         # Reserves space to insert multicut vias in postroute stage. This option has to be set before routing. After routing with this parameter specified, you can add
                                         # double-cut vias or larger overhang vias by using the "routeDesign -viaOpt" command. For examples, see routeDesign. (bool, default=false)
-routeReverseDirection <value>           # reverse routing direction in area: (lx ly ux uy [bot_lyr : top_lyr]) ... , top_lyr and bot_lyr could be either layer name or layer routing id (string, default="")
